{"unit_id": "tag:01MS:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为分次环（graded ring）。令<MATH_0002>。\n设<MATH_0003>是齐次（homogeneous）的，其次数（degree）为<MATH_0004>。\n层（sheaves）<MATH_0005>是可逆（invertible）的，而且对所有<MATH_0006>实际上都是平凡（trivial）的（见《模（Modules）》中的定义<REF_0001>）。\n映射（maps）（<REF_0002>）在<MATH_0007>上的限制（restricted to）\n<MATH_0008>，\n映射（maps）（<REF_0003>）在<MATH_0009>上的限制（restricted to）\n<MATH_0010>，\n以及映射（maps）（<REF_0004>）在<MATH_0011>上的限制（restricted to）\n<MATH_0012>，\n对所有<MATH_0013>均为同构（isomorphisms）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "trivial", "target_term": "平凡"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "restricted to", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "restricted to", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "restricted to", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "设定引理所用的环及其分次结构。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次", "context": "描述分次环中具有指定次数的元素。"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数", "context": "指齐次元的分次次数。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指引理断言可逆且平凡的对象。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "描述所列层的性质，定义见所引章节。"}, {"source_term": "trivial", "target_term": "平凡", "context": "描述所列层对给定范围内所有指标的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所引定义所在的章节标题。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指第一组引用的映射。"}, {"source_term": "restricted to", "target_term": "限制", "context": "指取第一组映射在指定对象上的限制。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指第二组引用的映射。"}, {"source_term": "restricted to", "target_term": "限制", "context": "指取第二组映射在指定对象上的限制。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指第三组引用的映射。"}, {"source_term": "restricted to", "target_term": "限制", "context": "指取第三组映射在指定对象上的限制。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "描述三组映射的限制共有的性质。"}], "notes": []}
